4.5 Laplacian of Scalar and Vector Fields
The scalar field V (x, y) and its Laplacian are computed in the following MATLAB
script file. The Laplacian and the field are displayed as subplots for comparison.
[x,y]  meshgrid(-1.5:0.1:1.5,-1.5:0.1:1.5);
V  x.*y.*exp(-x.^2-y.^2);
lap  4*del2(V);
subplot(2,1,1);
mesh(x,y,V)
axis equal
colormap bone
title('Scalar Field')
subplot(2,1,2);
mesh(x,y,lap)
axis equal
title('Laplacian of Scalar Field')
colormap bone
